### Add a listing as the landlord
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2400,
  "parking": true,
  "description": "Bright apartment near the university."
}

### Add a listing without a token (expected 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Zana 10",
  "rooms": 1,
  "area": 30,
  "price": 1800,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Should be rejected."
}

### Add a listing as a regular user (expected 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Zana 10",
  "rooms": 1,
  "area": 30,
  "price": 1800,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Should be rejected."
}

### All listings (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### Update listing 1 as its owner
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2200,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Price reduced."
}

### Delete listing 1 as its owner
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}